72
00:01:12,540 --> 00:01:13,680
Bilimin cevabı şu:

73
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:14,340
Evet,

74
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:15,700
hepimizin paylaştığı

75
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:16,340
bir zemin var.

76
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:17,400
Ama bu zemin

77
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,500
