96
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,360
İnsan,

97
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:40,780
özgürlüğe mahkûmdur.

98
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:42,480
Jung'a göre bu,

99
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:43,580
bütün insanlığın

100
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,180
